\subsection{Effective Potential}

The effective potential is
\begin{equation}
U_{\text{eff}}(y) =
e^{-4ky} \frac{d^2V}{d\Phi^2}
=
e^{-4ky}\left(2\lambda + 12\lambda_4 \Phi^2(y)\right).
\end{equation}

Anharmonicity increases curvature near the IR brane.

